Pasal 20
Penyelenggaraan pelayanan dan pendampingan terhadap korban, dilakukan dengan prinsip:
a. non diskriminasi;
b. cepat, aman, dan empati;
c. koordinasi antar instansi pemerintah;
d. adanya jaminan kerahasiaan;
e. mudah dijangkau; dan
f. tidak dipungut biaya.

translated_text:
Article 20
The provision of services and assistance to victims is carried out with the principles of:
a. non-discrimination;
b. fast, safe, and empathetic;
c. coordination between government agencies;
d. guarantee of confidentiality;
e. easily accessible; and
f. free of charge.

